sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Dev as 开发者/部署
    participant Cfg as app.core.config
    participant Main as app.main:create_app
    participant IR as import_router
    participant QR as query_router
    participant UV as uvicorn

    Note over Dev,Cfg: === 启动流程 ===
    Dev->>UV: uvicorn app.main:app --port $APP_PORT
    UV->>Main: import app.main
    Main->>Cfg: load_dotenv() + 构建 Settings(单例)
    Cfg-->>Main: settings
    Main->>IR: include_router(import_router)
    Main->>QR: include_router(query_router)
    Main-->>UV: FastAPI app (含 9 端点)

    Note over Dev,UV: === 导入流程 (POST /upload) ===
    participant Client as 浏览器(import.html)
    participant BG as BackgroundTasks
    participant Graph as kb_import_app

    Client->>IR: POST /upload (files)
    IR->>IR: 保存本地 + MinIO 上传
    IR->>BG: add_task(run_graph_task)
    IR-->>Client: {task_ids}
    BG->>Graph: stream(state)
    Graph-->>BG: 节点完成事件
    Client->>IR: GET /status/{task_id} (轮询)

    Note over Dev,UV: === 问答流程 (POST /query) ===
    participant SSE as /stream SSE
    participant QG as query_app

    Client->>QR: POST /query {query, session_id, is_stream}
    QR->>QR: create_sse_queue(session_id)
    QR->>BG: add_task(run_query_graph)
    QR-->>Client: {session_id}
    Client->>SSE: GET /stream/{session_id}
    BG->>QG: invoke(state)
    QG-->>SSE: SSEEvent 推送答案
    Client->>QR: GET /history/{session_id}
